OL,3,GNEWSAMuseum marks 175th birthday of
OL,4,Aperforming elephant
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe 175th birthday of a performing
OL,7,Felephant has been marked at the museum
OL,8,Fwhere its skeleton is on display.
OL,10,FNorman, an Asian elephant, toured the
OL,11,FUK with Manders Menagerie in the 19th
OL,12,FCentury, with newspapers reporting he
OL,13,Fcould perform tricks like jumping
OL,14,Fhurdles and playing the piano.
OL,16,FHis bones are now the centrepiece of
OL,17,Fthe Cole Museum of Zoology on the
OL,18,FUniversity of Reading's Whiteknights
OL,19,Fcampus, where they are used to educate
OL,20,Fboth students and visitors.
OL,23,APub: 25-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
