OL,3,GNEWSAMuseum marks 175th birthday of
OL,4,Aperforming elephant
OL,5,
OL,6,FStaff and students gathered on Tuesday
OL,7,Ffor the milestone anniversary, with
OL,8,FProf Amanda Callaghan, curator of the
OL,9,Fmuseum, saying they "couldn't let his
OL,10,F175th birthday pass without a
OL,11,Fcelebration".
